# Line endings, settled.
#
# The repo had drifted to 55 CRLF files against 89 LF ones with nothing
# arbitrating, so a tool that writes in the "wrong" dialect turns a thirteen-line
# change into an 862-line diff. That happened, which is why this file exists.
#
# `text=auto` stores everything as LF in git and checks it out however the
# platform wants. Nobody has to think about it again.
* text=auto

# Binary, so git never tries to "fix" the bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.aab binary
*.apk binary
*.p8 binary
